            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cube Runner</strong> is a fast-paced 3D action platformer that is easy to learn but difficult to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge obstacles, destroy everything in your way, and keep moving at high speed. Master your reflexes and timing, resist gravity, switch dimensions at the right moment, and survive for as long as possible as the challenge becomes increasingly demanding.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why play Cube Runner?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced and easy-to-learn gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive and challenging experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun to play with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements and rewards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare for impossible challenges and push your skills to the limit.</strong></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cube Runner</strong> is a fast-paced 3D action platformer that is easy to learn but difficult to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge obstacles, destroy everything in your way, and keep moving at high speed. Master your reflexes and timing, resist gravity, switch dimensions at the right moment, and survive for as long as possible as the challenge becomes increasingly demanding.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why play Cube Runner?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced and easy-to-learn gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive and challenging experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun to play with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements and rewards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare for impossible challenges and push your skills to the limit.</strong></p>",
            "short_description": "Cube Runner is a 3d action platformer that's simple to learn, exciting to play, and deep enough to challenge even the greatest gamers.",
